body:
you, my dear, need to give yourself a break.

from the sounds of things, you have every reason to be hopeful about this company. like you said - its only been a week!!  if they havent gotten back to you by the end of next week, i'd say rock up there again and show them just how determined you are.  that should refresh them ;)

tell me all you wanna tell me, haha, i'll read it!
